      ],
      "rationale": "Qiyana is in pro jail: 57% pro presence while she sits below 49% win rate in solo queue (47.7% global, 48.2% KR). Her coordinated late-game burst is what keeps her picked in pro, so we're trimming her end-of-game damage and leaving her early game alone. Q (Edge of Ixtal) damage at ranks 4/5 goes from 160/190 to 150/165, and R (Supreme Display of Talent) bonus AD ratio goes from 1.25 to 1.10. Q ranks 1-3, all base stats, W and E are unchanged, so her lane and early skirmish power stay the same for solo queue players. In simulation, pro power drops by about 1.2% and solo queue power doesn't change. Lane trades and the level 9 duel are untouched; only late DPS and siege damage go down slightly."
     }
    }
